{"candidateAnswer":"two","evidence":"[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?\n[D24:2 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: Hi Audrey! Pets really can make our lives better, huh? Speaking of which, I've got some awesome news -- I recently adopted another pup from a shelter. He's the best.","itemId":"urn:uuid:0d78c30c-2b89-56db-a6b8-edf032a9797e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9eb0c160952ed4f41630aec92ec73ec04297f2b77d51f500d14e1dc1fcceeddc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many pets did Andrew have, as of September 2023?","referenceAnswer":"one","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9eb0c160952ed4f41630aec92ec73ec04297f2b77d51f500d14e1dc1fcceeddc"}}]}